+            "tokenEnv": { "type": "string", "description": "Name of the environment variable holding the reviewer identity's GitHub token. /promote reads it and runs `gh pr review --approve` + `gh pr merge` with GH_TOKEN set to its value, for the approve/merge step only. If the variable is empty/unset at run time, or its gh identity equals the PR author, /promote fails CLOSED to HUMAN. Conventional name: HARNESS_PROMOTE_REVIEWER_TOKEN." }
