diff --git a/plugin/engine/lib/risk.ps1 b/plugin/engine/lib/risk.ps1
index 18b9436..797a9a2 100644
--- a/plugin/engine/lib/risk.ps1
+++ b/plugin/engine/lib/risk.ps1
@@ -272,138 +272,147 @@ function Get-DeterministicRisk {
   consulted. In particular the prod refusal does not read promotion.prod.autoMerge at all: the
   schema's `const: false` protects repos that validate their config in CI, and this line protects
   the ones that do not.
 
   Takes the deterministic tier AND the classifier's verdict as SEPARATE arguments and computes their
   max() itself (the escalate-only merge) so a caller cannot substitute a single hand-picked tier.
 
