$ gh pr review 9 --approve
failed to create review: GraphQL: Review Can not approve your own pull request (addPullRequestReview)
exit_code=1

Conclusion: the account that opened PR #9 cannot approve it. A single-identity
auto-approve step would ALWAYS fail here — which is why /promote treats a failed
approval as HUMAN and never falls through to merge.
