54:Source the engine lib and run it. PowerShell:
55:```
56:. "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/engine/lib/risk.ps1"
57:$cfg = Get-Content harness/harness.config.json -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json
58:$sig = Get-DiffSignals $BASE HEAD
59:$det = Get-DeterministicRisk -Config $cfg -Files $sig.Files -ChangedLines $sig.ChangedLines -AddedText $sig.AddedText
60:```
